@guide H_Stonetalon
@name Stonetalon Mountains (Sun Rock Retreat)
@faction Horde
@levels 21-25
@zone Stonetalon Mountains
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Sun Rock Retreat, Malaka'jin, the Venture Co. at Windshear Crag and the harpies. A short stop before Ashenvale.
@next H_Ashenvale

turnin Letter to Jin'Zil [optional] | Witch Doctor Jin'Zil, if you took the letter in the Barrens.
accept Jin'Zil's Forest Magic | Witch Doctor Jin'Zil, Malaka'jin (south).
turnin 1510 News of Dogran [class=Warlock; race=Orc,Undead,Blood Elf]
accept 1511 Ken'zigla's Draught [class=Warlock; race=Orc,Undead,Blood Elf]
turnin 6461 Blood Feeders [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll]
accept 1535 Call of Water [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll]
complete 1535 Call of Water [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll]
turnin 1535 Call of Water [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll] | Turned in at The Barrens.
turnin 1511 Ken'zigla's Draught [class=Warlock; race=Orc,Undead,Blood Elf] | Turned in at The Barrens.
accept 1515 Dogran's Captivity [class=Warlock; race=Orc,Undead,Blood Elf]
turnin 1515 Dogran's Captivity [class=Warlock; race=Orc,Undead,Blood Elf] | Turned in at The Barrens.
accept 1512 Love's Gift [class=Warlock; race=Orc,Undead,Blood Elf]
accept 6641 Vorsha the Lasher [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll] | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
complete 6641 Vorsha the Lasher [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll] | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin 6641 Vorsha the Lasher [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll] | Turned in at Ashenvale.
turnin 1512 Love's Gift [class=Warlock; race=Orc,Undead,Blood Elf] | Turned in at Orgrimmar.
accept 2458 Deep Cover [class=Rogue; race=Orc,Undead,Troll,Blood Elf]
turnin 1063 The Elder Crone | Turned in at Thunder Bluff.
accept 1064 Forsaken Aid [optional]
turnin 1095 Further Instructions
turnin 1064 Forsaken Aid [optional] | Turned in at Thunder Bluff.
turnin 5642 Shadowguard [class=Priest; race=Troll] | Turned in at Orgrimmar.
turnin 2458 Deep Cover [class=Rogue; race=Orc,Undead,Troll,Blood Elf] | Turned in at The Barrens.
accept Trouble in the Deeps | Tsunaman. Turned in at Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale (next guide).
accept Cenarius' Legacy | Braelyn Firehand.
fp Sun Rock Retreat
turnin 6401 Kaya's Alive
turnin 6284 Arachnophobia [class=Shaman; race=Orc,Tauren,Troll]
accept Harpies Threaten | Maggran Earthbinder, Sun Rock Retreat.
bind Sun Rock Retreat
accept Elemental War
accept 1090 Gerenzo's Orders | Piznik at the Windshear mine.
complete Harpies Threaten | Bloodfury harpies on the ridge east of Sun Rock.
complete Jin'Zil's Forest Magic | Venture Co. operators and Stonetalon creatures.
complete 1090 Gerenzo's Orders | Venture Co. at Windshear Crag.
turnin 1090 Gerenzo's Orders
complete Cenarius' Legacy
turnin Cenarius' Legacy
accept Ordanus
turnin Harpies Threaten
accept Bloodfury Bloodline
complete Bloodfury Bloodline
complete Elemental War
complete Ordanus | Ordanus is in the Sons of Cenarius camp.
turnin Bloodfury Bloodline
turnin Ordanus
turnin Elemental War
turnin Jin'Zil's Forest Magic
level 24
train | Orgrimmar or Thunder Bluff.
note Take the Talondeep Path north-east into Ashenvale; Splintertree Post is the Horde town.
